### Split-by-surface ownership (`split-by-surface`)

Path rules in `docs-check.conf` evaluate top-to-bottom (first match wins); unmatched paths fall back to `language_primary`.

| Path glob | Locale | Role | Rule |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `{{OWNER_GLOB}}` | `en` | `owner` | Canonical technical contracts, schemas, flags, and API invariants. |
| `{{DERIVED_GLOB}}` | `zh` | `derived` | Reading-oriented guides and notes; link canonical English contracts instead of duplicating specs. |

- Keep exact source identifiers, CLI flags, config keys, and file paths verbatim in English on Chinese surfaces.
- Never silently mix languages within one file; link across surfaces instead.
